  "title": "A static platelet\u2013white-cell interaction did not improve elevated-CRP prediction in separate NHANES samples",
  "abstract": "A registered platelet-count by white-cell-count interaction did not demonstrate incremental prediction of CRP>=3mg/L: separate-sample Brier loss changed from 0.168887872 to 0.168970410, gain -0.000082537 (two-sample stratified-PSU bootstrap95% interval -0.001026031 to 0.000350625). Nonlinear conventional baseline;5077source/5438target adults. Separate survey samples,not independent clinical settings;AI-authored negative result.",
